OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fbright end to the day with some late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Staying dry through this
OL,8,Fevening and overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells, however areas of low cloud,
OL,10,Fmist and fog forming later. Not as
OL,11,Fchilly as last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,14,Fgradually clearing to leave a rather
OL,15,Fcloudy day. Turning damp through the
OL,16,Fafternoon with a band of intermittent
OL,17,Flight rain arriving from the
OL,18,Fnorthwest. Cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
