OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFine
OL,6,Fon Saturday with some sunshine.
OL,7,FTurning windier on Sunday with rain
OL,8,Farriving later, perhaps heavy in
OL,9,Fplaces. Fine again on Monday with
OL,10,Fplenty of sunshine. Temperatures
OL,11,Fremaining above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
